          <h1>Art</h1>
          <p>Art to me is so much more then exspression. Its a way to show peices of you to the world.
            I've always liked making stuff thats diffrent, a bit out of the box. I've been drawn to mediums 
            like videoography, pixel art, minecraft builds, ciramics, and watercolor. I think everyone 
            has some big and amazing creative peice or project in them. All they have to do is pickup a 
            brush or a pencil and start making. I hope to one day have a gallery of my art, but for now,
             you can see some of it here on this website. <img src="paint.gif" alt="paint gif">
             <img src="nightstar.gif" alt="nightstar gif">
          </p>
